{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "09e9b2088fa078167852e0975045c9b7b854226d19352624e68d30ced70f7921", "ja": "英雄", "zh": "英雄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5c7e13e2677f6c190e703789957265ac876894794f6e2c0cbaa7d5a8e6b2b869", "ja": "紬との戦いの最中、マコトの消滅を察する\nカオリ。苛烈な戦いに紬は防戦一方となるが\n己が何のためにヒーローになったかを思い\n出した紬は、遂にカオリを打ち倒す。紬は\nその拳で、世界と姉の想いを守りきった。", "zh": "歌织在与䌷对战时，察觉真已被消灭。\n尽管实力太过悬殊，䌷只能埋头防守，\n但䌷最终想起自己成为英雄的理由，\n总算打败了歌织。䌷用自己的拳头，\n守住了世界与姊姊的意念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "1d05cb10ca0c6a28d7fc048d828b2982f64dca989af5b514157323ea73f7c7a1", "ja": "マコト？\n……………………消えたか。馬鹿め。", "zh": "真？\n……………………消失了啊，那个笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9eda60e09beb9e1b530543ac0acf23e34f6de557728674dcda37c6fefbf48a4e", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。ね、姉さん……。\nお願い、もうこんな酷いことはやめて……！", "zh": "呼、呼……姊、姊姊……\n拜托你，别再做这么过分的事了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1002_se", "source_sha256": "35e15956d1f43a9547a5a7afe26313052d115c6648fe572489ab3e5772cc17ed", "ja": "ザンッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e27e0bf508ac1e1c6d4cef8b7e914d6f28aa90c124e01181433b4ee0e0e66a57", "ja": "あぐっ！？", "zh": "啊唔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "3d17798a2ede7139b61b5142833f82a53396ae6d505a6b2053886d5ebab59b8d", "ja": "酷い？　一体何が酷いというのだ、ヒーロー。\nこの世界は力が全て。それ以外に何がある？", "zh": "过分？我到底哪里过分了，英雄？\n这个世界就是力量至上，除此之外还有别的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "b1b231c4bd2fdaf0e3db6defa0906efd4b6f98783416d50699f1bbed7e990caf", "ja": "貴様の姉は、己のデストルドー因子に負けた。\n内なる暴力の衝動、ダークパワーに屈したのだ。", "zh": "你的姊姊输给了自己的死欲因子，\n屈服于内在的暴力冲动，也就是暗黑力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1006_se", "source_sha256": "a58e4cbc0366c3cd1219d4b4042375e3c9724efd7957a3779dcd6165c1436f1c", "ja": "ザシュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9bfecf90dffab97186dda07c67576497a712a1815cf4b472b3d171b8e061fae5", "ja": "あぐっ！？　あ、あぁ……！", "zh": "啊唔！？啊、啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "7909dc66198c4909c0de8634b1254fbbd7ba8b2ea764c080eed2f4891c4beb19", "ja": "どうした、遠慮はいらないぞ？\nそのキネティックパワーで、私をねじ伏せてみせろ！", "zh": "怎么了？不用客气啊！\n就用你的动能威力，想办法让我屈服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "669d902c484c7bd917e5b6f1709331eec757e758e56d593e6efec9cdb813d70d", "ja": "貴様の内にも眠る、デストルドー因子を使え！\nダークパワーを解放し、全てを解き放て！！", "zh": "快用你体内也有的死欲因子！\n将暗黑力量释放出来，解放一切吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3b21a8c944916cdbd6ccddc92ad231c9fa2b4b0fe347bf28fcc0f81824786088", "ja": "うぅ……目を覚まして、姉さん……。\nこんなの、姉さんらしくない……！", "zh": "呜呜……快清醒啊，姊姊……\n这样一点也不像你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "fce9db66e134484b3aab46e80ea4ebc3d9db6f80a0b792bc968af89b81a2493f", "ja": "っ……つむ、ぎ……。\n……にげて……はやく……！", "zh": "唔……䌷……\n……你快……逃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1543934346cf910ebcf7f9d48781fb899f5c78f5e415a956f02635f3c2bd99a5", "ja": "！？　姉さん……！？", "zh": "！？姊姊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "eeda7bcf92cf94c4c9a4290f9716beaf60bc433f30db75de22c0d7a3aa9ddf0a", "ja": "この私に肉体を奪われて、尚も抵抗するか……。\nふふ。流石はヒーロー、と褒めてやろうか？", "zh": "躯体都被我夺走了，居然还想抵抗……\n呵呵，该说真不愧是英雄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "9734a9bb4154cdc2b0ec989e56c0770aa87c39cfad8054a7e842948cfd09d53e", "ja": "だが今や、何の力もない。貴様が命をかけて守ろうと\nしていたものは、私が全て破壊し尽くしてやる！", "zh": "但你现在已经没有任何的力量，\n你舍命想守护的一切，我都会破坏殆尽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "289dea3c883d6c47d7320ac43df56cb5b97bcc7166fb8fa55c8c447b30aaaca6", "ja": "姉さんが、守ろうとしていたもの。\n……そうだ。姉さんはいつだって、守ろうとしていた。", "zh": "姊姊想守护的事物……\n没错，姊姊总是很努力去守护一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "387ea4077856729e92b621a3b6fa2f46e805f6d6108d042083a727379e1f38c7", "ja": "私がまだ小さくて、この力が何なのかわからず\n泣いていた時も……大丈夫よって……。", "zh": "在我还小，还不知道这股力量是什么，\n只会哭泣时……姊姊也总在旁说着不要紧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8b644f0e003e98069864a26353bced4e13d4b9579e6a194c21866f12211243c5", "ja": "キネティックパワーは、人を傷付けるために\nあるんじゃない。守るためにあるんだから、って……。", "zh": "告诉我动能威力不是用来伤人，\n而是用来保护人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "4130c493c41dd64d7be9b671be1d173351a49a99c9f7b824fc2740660d23ff0d", "ja": "だがそれも力。元を辿れば全て同じ……姉と同じく、\nデストルドー因子を持つ貴様には、その才がある！", "zh": "但那终归也是力量，本质都一样……你跟你姊相同，\n身上都有死欲因子，天生就有这个资质！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0543866d11afb752617555a61b598a5d328a6067a93cd2855e9b531ab7dbee1b", "ja": "姉さんはこの世界を、人々を……私たちを守ってた！\nだからこんなこと、姉さんは絶対に望んでいない！", "zh": "姊姊一直在守护世界、守护世人……守护我们！\n所以她绝对不希望看到这种事发生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "f5b53454f82e5d0d5062bd2d9f963adbd41875ba4bbf7e1a83cee8d8175601b3", "ja": "ほう、やっと目覚めたか。いいぞ紬、戦いに委ねろ！\nその身も、心も……血肉の一片までも、暴力に捧げろ！", "zh": "哦，终于醒悟了啊。很好，䌷，投入战斗吧！\n将你的身心……每一滴血每一块肉，都献给暴力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "7888d33857ad22efbf3ece6256d4f1855cb8810b0c371f9cb4459fdc201f130b", "ja": "はぁっ！", "zh": "喝啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b5e9e84a3ddbd33efd2c111ec06ca203a145b31283762addd1dd2909e228208f", "ja": "はあぁーーーーっ！", "zh": "喝啊啊────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1023_se", "source_sha256": "1aaaefde53493e870840dfef74c465068dced635fd242160318e59abd49b80fa", "ja": "ヒュッ！　シュバッ！", "zh": "咻！咻啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d1a17212c0cd036d99442a23260ee9e836660ce8b9d38c20787eacea25d04995", "ja": "ぐっ……！？　あ、あぁっ……！", "zh": "唔……！？啊、啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "4696a8dfec3b951d89648eb2c3c77e1a78c00fedc4f37efb16e7a9ef694018d5", "ja": "ふふふ、ははははは……終わりだ、ヒーローズ！\n私を止められる者は、最早誰もいない！", "zh": "呵呵呵、哈哈哈哈哈……到此为止了，英雄联盟！\n已经没有人可以阻止我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "579e1c84315d364d4de30065d61268a8ba8ea8390a8bc67e362c2dca08f9ee2f", "ja": "かつて、貴様らの希望だったこの力で、地表ごと消し\n去ってやろう。そして正義の無力を、欺瞞を思い知れ！", "zh": "我会用这股曾被你们视为希望的力量，将你们连同\n地表一起彻底消灭！好好体会正义的无力和虚伪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3915ad1e21fb13436c0dcb6f62f098bee85793a41a10992106f689796c4c53d", "ja": "おお、おおぉぉっ……！", "zh": "喔喔、喔喔喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1028_se", "source_sha256": "7d4d5588eabf2d003a97f50f56934777833e446c4e15f65b4bc47ff68c99a6ab", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea9642140581b7cd37c345a7d63f24ae93519198bf2aad4952450d569a295171", "ja": "……っ……。", "zh": "……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "1063bc170a90adb4af09368b78234c9052aa10fb8cdd8e8e8a4dc07eee99593b", "ja": "何っ！？　この私のデストサーベルを受けて、\nまだ生きているだと……！？", "zh": "什么！？接下我的死欲军刀，\n居然还活着……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e69dc6ac6f92c0afc17809d98b2115881bab34fecd94675a05967850d931b04e", "ja": "姉さんが死んだって聞いて……。\n守らなきゃ、って思った……。", "zh": "听闻姊姊的死讯时……\n我就觉得自己得站出来不可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d4914dc5b5d821efab6d8fc72527452230b35d26b4745a8fa6147ac720b5800c", "ja": "私は守られるばかりで、姉さんを守れなかった。\nだから、代わりに……ヒーローに、なると決めたの！！", "zh": "过去的我只会接受姊姊的庇护，没能保护姊姊。\n所以，我才会决定……要代替姊姊，成为英雄！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1033_se", "source_sha256": "7d4d5588eabf2d003a97f50f56934777833e446c4e15f65b4bc47ff68c99a6ab", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "570c830e3f76c1e89d687d2838fcdb5d8e233176ff5131b557f726cab0349a83", "ja": "その力は……！　そうか、私のデストサーベルから\nダークパワーを取り込んで、目覚めたな！？", "zh": "那股力量是……！我懂了，你从我的死欲军刀\n吸收暗黑力量，觉醒了是吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "85a1d4455d728e33c2be4ff469c69f3c351aeb023a6f6e5349fc7c7edb571399", "ja": "はーっはっはっは、面白い！！\n貴様と私のパワー、どちらが上か……見極めてやろう！", "zh": "哈──哈哈哈，有意思！！\n你和我，究竟谁的力量更强……就让我瞧瞧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "a3b1f899dbba3618a34e66a9760e888020977dbdd525123213ef4100c23addab", "ja": "アトミック……", "zh": "原子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "273aa7998a216c39db565c28e38b56919c66546a41db32463e5b47af794f150b", "ja": "キネティック……", "zh": "动能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
