{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "6451e2c1034948fb6ac2ec19bff1b5711993b65c283f22c83c54908eebe8c842", "ja": "これは……ダークパワーではない！？　ダークパワーを\nキネティックパワーに変換させたというのか……！？", "zh": "这个……不是暗黑力量！？\n难道你将暗黑力量转换成动能威力了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c66f0827a54906545594746224a2d7075c6f34e49701d6e4b34fbee31d4ffb7f", "ja": "この力は、私だけのものじゃない。\nこの拳には姉さんの……ヒーローの想いが乗っている！", "zh": "这股力量，不只是我一个人的。\n我的拳头带有姊姊……身为英雄的意念！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "88809d9c966638cb59f0cf597e069cbde2db1f04f572e8957445161a732c9993", "ja": "この世界を、姉さんを守るには、こうするしかない……\nだから、姉さん……ごめんなさい……！", "zh": "为了守护这个世界、守护姊姊，我别无选择……\n姊姊……对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "5b865d422028db759cbc794dfbaddb51103fd26cb29ba990d2db4373b099950b", "ja": "……………………。\nありがとう、……紬……。", "zh": "……………………\n谢谢你……䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e957023f73a9582aee461f6bde74087dd236d96d558bd03f0a85ee714ea14089", "ja": "！？　姉、さん……。", "zh": "！？姊、姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_08_1046_051tmg", "source_sha256": "475ae63a87cc5629e88944582122d23c0e3b86d7752fee494552ee49f76cfff9", "ja": "う、うぅ……！\nうわああああぁぁぁぁぁぁぁぁーっ！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……！\n唔哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
